# Decision flow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
  A[Load study profile] --> B{Source metadata M2+?}
  B -->|No| X[BLOCKED: resolve source]
  B -->|Yes| C{Common effective support valid?}
  C -->|No| Y[NOT COMPARABLE: support mismatch]
  C -->|Yes| D{Quality/missingness passes?}
  D -->|No| Z[BLOCKED: insufficient data]
  D -->|Yes| E[Compute feature distributions]
  E --> F[Run predeclared scenarios]
  F --> G{Pairwise ranks stable?}
  G -->|No| H[TIE/INDETERMINATE: show rank flips]
  G -->|Yes| I{One eligible non-dominated unit?}
  I -->|No| H
  I -->|Yes| J[FOLLOW-UP STUDY CANDIDATE]
  J --> K[Attach transfer-gap ledger]
  H --> K
  X --> K
  Y --> K
  Z --> K
  K --> L[Generate draft study protocol]
```
